      "name": "page_no",
      "options": [
        "--page-no"
      ],
      "raw_name": "PageNo",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "false",
      "help_en": "Specifies whether to merge the first few pages of a PDF and return the merged recognition result (supports up to the first 4 pages). For example, if a PDF has 3 pages and this parameter is set to true, the recognition results of the first 3 pages are returned.  \nThe default value is false.  \nIf the total number of pages in the uploaded PDF exceeds 4 and this parameter is set to true, only the first 4 pages are recognized (this parameter does not support selecting arbitrary page numbers).  \nIf PageNo is specified and MergePdfPages is set to true, MergePdfPages is ignored, and only the page specified by PageNo is recognized.  ",
      "help_zh": "是否合并PDF的前几页，并返回合并页的识别结果（最大支持返回前4页识别结果）。例如上传的PDF有3页，且设置此参数为true，返回前3页所有识别结果。\n默认为false。\n如果上传的PDF总页数大于4页，且设置此参数为true，则只识别前4页（此参数不支持选择任意页码号）。\n如果设置了 PageNo，同时 MergePdfPages 设置为true，则 MergePdfPages 不生效，会识别 PageNo 指定的PDF页面",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "merge_pdf_pages",
      "options": [
        "--merge-pdf-pages"
      ],
      "raw_name": "MergePdfPages",
      "required": false,
      "type": "bool"
    }
  ],
